<title>JAPAN: Nippon Broadcast sets minimum share auction price.</title>
<headline>Nippon Broadcast sets minimum share auction price.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Broadcasting System Inc said on Wednesday it would offer its shares at or above 1,950 yen per share when it auctions its stock.</p>
<p>A total of 2.0 million shares will be offered to the public, half of them through an auction, the company said.</p>
<p>The issue is due to go public on the Tokyo Stock Exchange's second section on December 2.</p>
</text>
